[en.DOCTRINE_ARMY_2_0_WALL_OF_UNITY]
Wall of Unity

[en.DOCTRINE_ARMY_2_0_WALL_OF_UNITY_DESC]
The more times you attack, the more desperate you become. When the enemy’s attacks are repeatedly repelled by our impregnable defenses, they will crumble before we even launch our own offensive.

[en.DOCTRINE_ARMY_2_0_WALL_OF_UNITY_desc]


[zh.DOCTRINE_ARMY_2_0_WALL_OF_UNITY]
团结铁壁

[zh.DOCTRINE_ARMY_2_0_WALL_OF_UNITY_DESC]
一鼓作气，再而衰，三而竭。当对方的进攻在我们坚不可摧的防御前屡屡受挫时，他们将在我们发起进攻前就崩溃。

[zh.DOCTRINE_ARMY_2_0_WALL_OF_UNITY_desc]
